---
description: Isar-first writes and offline sync behavior
globs: **/*.dart
alwaysApply: true
---

# Isar-First
- Write to Isar first for instant UI updates.
- Queue remote sync tasks after successful local writes.

# Offline + Sync
- Use retry for remote operations.
- Use conflict resolution when syncing (default: last-write-wins).

# Source of Truth
- App runtime should read from Isar (local cache).
- Remote calls are for refreshing data or syncing queued changes.

